CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'hba->query.request->upiu_req.opcode ==
 					UPIU_QUERY_OPCODE_WRITE_DESC'
#651: FILE: drivers/scsi/ufs/ufshcd.c:600:
